--[[
        UNIVERSAL CUSTOM ASSETS -- an animator for DOORS' things and your own

            loadstring(game:HttpGet("https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bonellocristian78-lab/Gradish-Mode/main/UniversalAssets"))()

        Hold Ctrl and type U, I, O: the panel opens (again, or X, to close it
        and lock the mouse back). Ctrl + P plays or stops, with the panel closed too.

        1. Insert something: a preset (DOORS' entities and furniture, some
           custom models) or any model by asset ID or .rbxm URL.
        2. Put it where you want (Here / Place), set a time and press + Key.
           Move it, change the time, + Key again: it will go from one to the
           other in that many seconds, with that easing.
        3. A key can also start an animation (a name from the model, or an ID)
           and a sound (a name from the model, or an ID). "stop" stops it.
        4. Play. Save / Load keep the whole project in your executor's folder.

        ANIMATIONS NOT OWNED BY THIS GAME
        Roblox plays an animation only in games owned by whoever uploaded it
        (in DOORS: LSPLASH). Those play normally. Any other one is converted
        when the model is inserted: its KeyframeSequence is downloaded and
        played by this script, joint by joint. Nothing is uploaded anywhere.
        A KeyframeSequence inside the model works the same way.

        Everything is local: only you see it.
        Settings: _G.UniversalAssets = { Combo = { "J", "K" }, ... } before the loadstring.
]]

